<div class="w-100 pull-left " data-parentid="" id="1615792824646902" data-pp="0" style="position: relative; font-size: 13px; font-weight: ; color: #333;line-height: 20px; margin-top:10px; text-align: JUSTIFY; ">
<div style="padding-left: 4rem; "><p>37.1.1. зөвшөөрлийг түдгэлзүүлэх;</p></div>
